# [IABOPEN](../wg/iabopen.html)

## Summary

The IABOPEN session at IETF 127 covered administrative and document updates from the Internet Architecture Board (IAB), a report on the recent IAB Workshop on Post-Quantum Authentication, an update from the IAB Liaison Coordinators, an invited talk on the legal and technical aspects of delegated authorization for AI agents, and an open mic discussion.

